    "difficulty": 12,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Horde, 2 / HP</h3>\n<p><em>A group of shambling corpses that move as one.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Consume flesh, hunger, maul</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 12 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 6/12 | <strong>HP:</strong> 6 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> -1 | Bite &amp; Claw: Melee | 1d10+2 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> None</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Horde (1d4+2) - Passive</strong>: When the Zombies have marked half or more of their HP, their standard attack deals 1d4+2 physical damage instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Overwhelm - Reaction</strong>: When the Zombies mark HP from an attack within Melee range, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to make a standard attack against the attacker.</p>\n",
